1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,500
You: "Alexa, I had two rotis, chicken karahi and a mango lassi for lunch."

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Alexa: Logged lunch, 904 calories. I assumed one plate of chicken karahi is 250 grams.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Alexa: You have 970 calories and 96 grams of protein left today.

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,000
You: "Actually, make that one roti."

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:33,500
Alexa: Updated. Lunch is now 785 calories, with 1,089 left today.

6
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,000
You: "Alexa, start push day."

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Alexa: Push day. Barbell bench press, set 1 of 3: 80 kilos for 8.

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,500
You: "Done, eight reps."

9
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:56,000
Alexa: New PR! Estimated one-rep max 101.3 kilos, up 2.6. Rest now.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
You: "My shoulder feels off. Swap the overhead press."

11
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:13,500
Alexa: Swapped to landmine press: 3 sets of 6 at 32.5 kilos.

12
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:20,000
You: "Plan my meal prep for the next four days and add what I need to my cart."

13
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Alexa: Here's a four-day plan at 2,256 calories a day.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Alexa: Add 12 items, about $112, to your Amazon cart?

15
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,500
You: "Yes."

16
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:53,500
Alexa: Done. 12 items, $112.44, are in your Amazon cart. You check out on Amazon.

17
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:57,000
[The next morning]

18
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
You: "Alexa, good morning."

19
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Alexa: Good morning. You lost 0.3 kilos this week against a planned 0.4, so I cut 110 calories, to 2,250.

20
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:21,500
Alexa: Today is legs: back squat 102.5 kilos for 5. Yesterday you ate 1,271 calories.

21
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:24,500
You: "How's my bench going?"

22
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:33,500
Alexa: Your bench is up 9.5 kilos in six weeks, from 91.8 to 101.3 estimated one-rep max.

23
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:41,000
Every turn is a real MCP call: protocol 2025-11-25 over Streamable HTTP, 18 tools.

24
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:47,500
The server runs on AgentCore Runtime, with Aurora Serverless v2 and an overnight Lambda.

25
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:53,500
Nova 2.5 Sonic is Alexa's voice. Nova 2 Lite makes the judgment calls; code checks every number.

26
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:58,500
Every fitness app makes you type. This one, you just talk to.
